<title>USA: CUC finalizes settlement agreement.</title>
<headline>CUC finalizes settlement agreement.</headline>
<dateline>STAMFORD, Conn. 1997-07-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>CUC International Inc said Wednesday that its previously announced settlement agreement with Peter Halmos, the co-founder of SafeCard Services Inc, has become effective.</p>
<p>The company previously announced that it had agreed to pay Halmos $70.5 million.</p>
<p>Halmos had sued SafeCard, making personal injury and other claims against SafeCard and SafeCard's previous owner, Ideon Group Inc. CUC acquired Ideon in 1996.</p>
<p>The three class action matters involving, among other parties, SafeCard, Ideon, CUC and certain Ideon and SafeCard directors and officers remain pending, CUC said.</p>
<p>CUC is a direct marketing firm.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610))</p>
</text>
